sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (Flutter)
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant NS as Notification Service
    participant DB as Notification DB

    U->>GW: GET /api/v1/notifications
    GW->>GW: Verify JWT
    GW->>NS: Proxy with user context
    NS->>DB: SELECT notifications by user_id
    DB-->>NS: Notification list
    NS-->>U: notifications + pagination

    U->>GW: GET /api/v1/notifications/unread-count
    GW->>NS: Proxy with user context
    NS->>DB: COUNT unread notifications
    NS-->>U: unread_count

    U->>GW: PATCH /api/v1/notifications/{id}/read
    GW->>NS: Proxy with user context
    NS->>DB: UPDATE read_at where owner matches
    NS-->>U: 204 No Content
